(1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Nokshi Kantha Heritage Quilt','nokshi-kantha-heritage-quilt','ZC-DEMO-001','A demo handmade piece for QA testing premium storefront and Commerce OS workflows.','This demo item is intentionally seeded for local and staging QA. It lets teams verify product cards, packages, cart, checkout, reviews, and analytics without relying on production data.',NULL,'Inspired by Bengali craft traditions, this demo piece carries the look and workflow metadata needed for Zenna Craft QA.','Cotton textile, artisan thread, soft lining.',NULL,'Approx. 40 x 50 cm.','Hand wash gently in cold water and dry in shade.',NULL,2850.00,3600.00,0.00,NULL,0,'active',0,0,0,'Nokshi Kantha Heritage Quilt | Demo Product','Demo QA product for Zenna Craft: Nokshi Kantha Heritage Quilt','2026-06-30 11:08:30','2026-07-21 00:46:06',NULL,0),
